{"id":"n62313-1-9","stage":1,"title":"뜨다 · 睁","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62313-1-9-1","ko":"왜 두 눈을 동그랗게 뜨고 있어?","zh":"你怎么把眼睛瞪得那么圆？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两。","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"눈을","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈을","audio":"/audio/5b944ed45a5a960e9d96.mp3"}},{"text":"동그랗게","meaning":"溜圆，圆圆的","explanation":"동그랗다：溜圆，圆圆的；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"동그랗다","audio":"/audio/2a6974b7d2bf6c02eb4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14795","senseId":"1","lemma":"동그랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동그랗게","audio":"/audio/7e895e3d3a18fab5067c.mp3"}},{"text":"뜨고","meaning":"睁，睁开","explanation":"뜨다：睁，睁开；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62313","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뜨고","audio":"/audio/a69a111d3bbacdf9248a.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"2a6974b7d2bf6c02","term":"동그랗다","zh":"溜圆，圆圆的","audio":"/audio/2a6974b7d2bf6c02eb4f.mp3","entryId":"14795","definition":"小而明显圆的。","pronunciation":["동그라타"]},{"id":"83c29e672f4ac6fe","term":"뜨다","zh":"睁，睁开","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3","entryId":"62313","definition":"张开闭着的眼睛。","pronunciation":["뜨다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f138d14974077630dbf3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62313-1-9-2","ko":"방금 승규한테 아주 놀라운 얘기를 들었거든.","zh":"我刚才刚从承奎那里听到了一件非常惊人的事。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才。","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}},{"text":"승규한테","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"승규한테","audio":"/audio/51130402fabcdb47ca81.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규한테","audio":"/audio/51130402fabcdb47ca81.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"놀라운","meaning":"惊人，出奇","explanation":"놀랍다：惊人，出奇；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"놀랍다","audio":"/audio/8889c7d331879f6907da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88324","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀랍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀라운","audio":"/audio/bd5a7fae82c97fc6afaa.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기를","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘기를","audio":"/audio/d30eac53cdc9b914c064.mp3"}},{"text":"들었거든.","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었거든","audio":"/audio/003aafc67a579c7b8049.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"8889c7d331879f69","term":"놀랍다","zh":"惊人，出奇","audio":"/audio/8889c7d331879f6907da.mp3","entryId":"88324","definition":"很好或很壮观，令人深受感动。","pronunciation":["놀ː랍따"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"谈话，说话","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"向某人诉说与某事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等有关的话。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"aud